TRANSLATION:
Nişanın iyidir umarım; balon{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
patlatma{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}} zamanı!{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} Elindeki{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
sapanla gökte süzülen balonları
vuracaksın. Rüzgâra dikkat;
balonların yönünü değiştirebilir!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Los globos redondos valen {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}un punto{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
y los que tienen forma de conejito
valen {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}tres puntos{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
¡Si consigues {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0007:0600}} puntos {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}en
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0007:0500}} minutos{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, te daré unas medallas!

{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Los globos redondos valen {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}un punto{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
y los que tienen forma de conejito
valen {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}tres puntos{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Si conseguís {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0007:0600}} puntos{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} en
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0007:0500}} minutos{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, granujillas, ¡os llevaréis
unas cuantas medallas!

TRANSLATION:
Hepsini anladın mı? Sapan
konusunda yardım{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} gerekirse{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
söyle{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}. Ben gençken keskin nişancıydım!

ES:
